     [38;5;246mAuto-subscribe on create/assign/comment, plus a watch/mute control. Needs a subscriptions table with a muted state.
[39m     [38;5;246mWhat GitHub and Linear do.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Implicit only
     [38;5;246mRecipients derived from the task row at send time — creator, assignee, commenters. No subscription storage, no UI.
[39m     [38;5;246mNobody can mute or watch.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Explicit watch only
     [38;5;246mYou get nothing until you press watch. Fully predictable, but silent by default, including for tasks assigned to [39m
     [38;5;246myou.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m Implicit + per-project defaults
     [38;5;246mRelationships subscribe you, and users set a default per project (all activity / participating / none). More knobs,
